d1-list-extraction
Copyright 2026 Joshua Bello.

This project adds an inference-time list decoder and text-only capture adapter around
Liquid AI's frozen d1-2B model. No model weights were fine-tuned or changed.

The bundled upstream LiquidONNX source is unmodified, from Liquid4All/onnx-export
commit 1712505e7e0c312e0fef5908c187a4e7c6f68121. Copyright and license notices
in that source remain applicable. Liquid AI's model and runtime use the LFM Open
License v1.0, included in LICENSE. This project is independent of Liquid AI.
